# Co-op terrain ROOT: a Scene-only entity every rock, ground marker and barrier segment is
# parented under, so the scene root stays lean and a map regeneration removes the whole set in
# one removeRootEntity. (World::createEmptyEntity cannot serve: it carries NO components, and an
# entity without a SceneComponent refuses children.)
# Global stays with CullMode None: the children's selection rule keys on the Global parent.
Prefab gameCoopTerrain
	Global true
	CullMode None
	Component Scene
